    <a href="/blog/career-options/best-paying-jobs-for-humanities-students-india/">best paying jobs for humanities students in India</a>
    for the wider view. This article assumes psychology is already the specific subject you are seriously
    weighing, and answers the narrower question families actually argue about: is it worth the years and
    the licensing maze, and which lane inside it makes that true.
  </p>

  <p>
    If you already know the direction and want the complete pay table across all six real tracks, read
    <a href="/blog/career-options/career-in-psychology-india-salary-scope/">career in psychology India salary scope</a>
    instead. Keep reading here if you are still deciding whether to choose the subject at all.
