  <h2 id="skills">Skills that actually move the pay needle</h2>

  <p>
    Whatever specific specialisation you eventually pick, the skills below are what actually separate the
    Rs 2-3 LPA outcome from the Rs 10 LPA+ outcome inside the same psychology degree.
  </p>

  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table class="paths-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Skill</th>
          <th>Why it matters</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {skillRows.map((item) => (
